        <content type="html"><![CDATA[<img src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93594?v=4" width="64" height="64" alt=""/><br/><p dir="auto"><code class="notranslate">&lt;div hidden="until-found"&gt;</code> and <code class="notranslate">&lt;details&gt;</code> auto-open when things are found within them. This landed later than <code class="notranslate">&lt;details&gt;</code>.</p>
